    rubber on site
  \item
    \textbf{Frame:} High-strength titanium or Inconel structure
  \item
    \textbf{Glazing:} Borosilicate glass with insulation layer
  \item
    \textbf{Roof:} Solar panels for energy generation
  \item
    \textbf{Airlock:} Titanium/Inconel construction with borosilicate
    glass
